  m_text: "Last Updated: June 2026\n\nWelcome to Golden Dragon Legend (\"the Game,\" \"we,\" \"our,\" or \"us\"). We value your privacy and are committed to protecting it. This Privacy Policy explains how information is collected, used, and protected when you use our mobile application.\n\nBy downloading or using Golden Dragon Legend, you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.\n\n1.Information We Collect\n1.1 Personal Information\n \nGolden Dragon Legend does not require user registration. We do not collect personal information such as your name, email address, phone number, or contact details.\n\n1.2 Automatically Collected Information\n \nTo ensure the Game functions properly and delivers a smooth experience, we may automatically collect limited non-personal information, including:\n·Device type and model\n·Operating system version\n·App usage data (such as gameplay progress, session duration, and feature interactions)\n·Performance data (such as crash logs and error reports)\n\nThis information is used solely for internal purposes.\n\n2.How We Use Information\nThe information we collect is used to:\n·Operate and maintain the Game\n·Improve gameplay experience and performance\n·Identify and fix bugs or crashes\n·Optimize game balance and features\n·Ensure a stable and enjoyable user experience\n\n3.Data Sharing\n \nWe do not sell, trade, or share your information with third parties.\n\nAll data collected is used only within the Game and for internal operational purposes.\n\n4.Data Storage and Security\nWe take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect collected information against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse.\n\nPlease note that no digital system can guarantee absolute security, but we strive to safeguard your data to the best of our ability.\n\n5.Children's Privacy\nGolden Dragon Legend is designed for general audiences and is not intended for children under the age of 13.\n\nWe do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe that a child has provided information to us, please contact us so we can take appropriate action.\n\n6.Your Privacy Choices\nYou may control certain privacy-related settings directly through your device, such as system permissions and app usage preferences.\n\nSince Golden Dragon Legend does not collect personal data, there is no account-based information to access, modify, or delete.\n\n7.Changes to This Policy\nWe may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be effective immediately upon posting within the App or on the App Store listing.\n\n8.Contact Us\nIf you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:\n\nEmail: jakbo.studio0109@gmail.com"
